WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.560
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a comedy-drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.200
called “Hichki”. Spoilers ahead!&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.520
Naina is a woman in her twenties&nbsp;
looking to get a job as a teacher.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.600
She has a Bachelor's degree in Education&nbsp;
and a Master's degree in Science,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:29.040
making her the perfect candidate academically.&nbsp;
However, her biggest drawback in life is that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:34.560
has Tourette's syndrome. This causes her to make&nbsp;
uncontrollable noises that sound like hiccups.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.240
Since she can hardly keep quiet because of&nbsp;
it, the interviewers believe that she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:48.720
unfit to be a teacher. Naina has been trying to&nbsp;
get a job for the past five years but to no luck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.080
She is now working as a freelance animator but&nbsp;
hasn’t given up on finding a job as a teacher. 
&nbsp;

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:59.360
Naina lives with her mother and younger brother&nbsp;
Vinay, both of whom support her unconditionally.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:04.080
A flashback shows us that when Naina was in middle&nbsp;
school, she used to be made fun of all the time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.800
The teachers didn’t understand that her&nbsp;
condition was uncontrollable and sent her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.600
outside the class when she made a noise.
This had a huge effect on her mental health&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:20.720
and she could hardly make friends. She was&nbsp;
transferred from twelve schools and was told to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:26.000
to the school for children with special needs. But&nbsp;
Naina’s mother Sudha was adamant about giving her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.680
daughter a normal life. The same cannot be said&nbsp;
for her father Sachin. He divorced Sudha after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.480
finding out that Naina had Tourette's and was&nbsp;
never present for the first few years of her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:41.200
He tried to bond with his children over the years&nbsp;
but every time they went out, he was embarrassed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:46.160
of Naina. He also urged Sudha to send her to&nbsp;
a special needs school but she didn’t give up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.120
on her daughter. The day Naina found out that her&nbsp;
parents divorced because of her, she shoved toilet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:57.040
paper into her mouth to try to prevent the noises.&nbsp;
She wanted to be liked by her father so badly that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.640
she blamed herself for not being good enough. 
Currently, Sachin does his best to be present in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:07.760
his children’s lives but Naina doesn’t welcome&nbsp;
him. He doesn’t support her dreams and wants her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:13.200
to take an easy banking job. One day, they get&nbsp;
into an argument about the matter when suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:17.840
Naina gets a call from her former school,&nbsp;
St. Notker's. They ask her to come in for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:22.320
a second interview, claiming that she has&nbsp;
gotten the job. A high school teacher at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:27.360
St. Notker resigned mid-term, leaving the&nbsp;
school’s board desperate for a new candidate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.600
Although Naina was not their first choice,&nbsp;
they had to hire her for the time being. 
&nbsp;

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:35.360
She goes for a follow-up interview with&nbsp;
the dean and fellow teachers. They are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:40.560
all skeptical because of obvious reasons but&nbsp;
Naina’s spirit impresses them. When asked why&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:44.640
she wants to be a teacher, she replies that&nbsp;
after being kicked out of twelve schools,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:50.960
she was accepted by St. Notker's, all thanks to&nbsp;
her former teacher Mr. Ali. A flashback shows us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:55.280
little Naina watching a drama performance&nbsp;
during a school function. While everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.280 --> 00:03:00.160
in the audience watches in silence, she cannot&nbsp;
help but make noise because of her Tourette.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.920
They look at her annoyed when the school’s&nbsp;
principal Mr. Ali calls her to the stage.
&nbsp;

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:13.120
He makes her explain her condition to the audience&nbsp;
and asks her what they can do to help her. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:17.200
listening to her story, the teachers of the&nbsp;
school understand her condition much better&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:22.800
and help her accordingly. Back in the interview,&nbsp;
she praises Mr. Ali, claiming that she wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:27.840
be a teacher because of him. Impressed with the&nbsp;
answer, the dean welcomes her to the school. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:33.920
a fellow teacher named Wadia bluntly declares that&nbsp;
it is a bad decision. The dean shows Naina around&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:40.640
the school and tells her that she is supposed to&nbsp;
teach class 9F, the students with the worst grades&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:45.760
in the school. On her first day at the job, Naina&nbsp;
goes to the auditorium, reminiscing about the day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:51.280
she was called to the stage. The students of class&nbsp;
9F enter the room but do not notice her. They&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:56.640
talk in foul street language and start smoking&nbsp;
cigarettes. Some of them play with their pet mice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:01.440
while the others play cards. They also talk&nbsp;
about Naina, calling her names and making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:06.240
fun of her hiccups like Tourette's. Naina&nbsp;
hears them but doesn’t confront them. 
&nbsp;

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:10.960
Later, she meets the students for the first&nbsp;
time and welcomes them to her class. Like she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:16.720
had thought, they make fun of her hiccups and call&nbsp;
her names. Their leader Aatish makes inappropriate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:22.000
comments about wanting to call Naina at night.&nbsp;
Still, when the students laugh, she laughs with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:27.280
them, not showing that their words affect her.&nbsp;
She also explains to them what Tourettes is. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:31.920
students realise that she heard their conversation&nbsp;
earlier and go quiet. But moments later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.800
they burst into laughter when Naina falls from&nbsp;
a broken chair while trying to sit on it. During&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:42.080
the lunch break, one of the school’s top-scoring&nbsp;
students, Akshay gets into an argument with Aatish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:47.200
about a punctured football. They get into a fight&nbsp;
but only Aatish is taken to the dean’s office.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:52.240
The following day, Naina meets the school’s&nbsp;
janitor and asks him the history of class 9F.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.240 --> 00:05:02.480
She finds out that everyone in class 9F lives&nbsp;
in a nearby slum in poverty. They were granted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:07.360
admission to the prestigious school because their&nbsp;
old municipal school was under heavy debt. 
&nbsp;

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:12.480
They had been promised good education but instead,&nbsp;
they faced prejudice from the teachers and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:18.240
wealthy students. With time, they retaliated and&nbsp;
became the people they are today. After finding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:23.440
out the truth, Naina is determined to help them&nbsp;
even more. But the students do not cooperate.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:28.480
They never pay attention when she is teaching, and&nbsp;
prank her every day. One time, they even go as far&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:34.000
as to paste her picture and phone number around&nbsp;
the neighborhood, advertising her as a sex worker.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:39.760
When Naina walks into the class the next morning,&nbsp;
she sees a bucket. On looking closer, it explodes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:43.920
and breaks the glass window. The students are&nbsp;
about to be expelled from the school because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:48.800
the pranks but Naina takes the blame on herself.&nbsp;
Claiming that the explosion was her fault,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:53.920
she asks the dean to give them one more chance.&nbsp;
When he tells her that the kids have no future,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:58.880
Naina insists that if they do not score good&nbsp;
results in the final exam, she will admit that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:03.680
was wrong and the students will be expelled.
The dean agrees and gives her four months' time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:08.640
to prove herself. Following that, she comes to the&nbsp;
classroom to the students who are grateful that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:12.960
she helped them. It is foreign to them because&nbsp;
no teacher of the school had treated them with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:18.160
respect till now. Starting the next day, the&nbsp;
students pay attention to when she teaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:23.120
and get along with her. Naina uses various&nbsp;
innovative techniques to keep them entertained.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:27.440
She even holds classes on the ground and&nbsp;
throws boiled eggs at them to explain about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:33.440
a parabola. All this time, Wadia watches her,&nbsp;
unimpressed by her teaching techniques. He is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:38.240
hoping for her downfall because he despises&nbsp;
the students of 9F. In one of the classes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:42.320
the students complain that they are never&nbsp;
considered for eligibility to be in the school’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:47.440
prefect’s team. Naina takes their concern to the&nbsp;
dean and is told that a student has to score more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:53.120
than ninety percent to be eligible. Waida laughs&nbsp;
at the thought of her students scoring that high&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:57.280
but Naina takes on the challenge. 
The next week, the school holds a parents’&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.320
teachers’ meeting. While all other teachers are&nbsp;
busy talking to the parents, Naina sits idle the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:07.440
entire time. Since the parents of the students&nbsp;
in 9F are busy trying to make minimum wage daily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:12.080
they hardly get time to be involved in their&nbsp;
children’s lives. Naina takes it upon herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:15.920
to go to the slums and meet the parents.&nbsp;
The lifestyle of the people living there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:20.800
makes her realize why the students have such a&nbsp;
hard time focusing on their studies. The kids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:26.000
and their parents have to wait in line for hours&nbsp;
just to get a bucket of water. The family barely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:30.800
earns enough to make a living, let alone to&nbsp;
invest on better stationeries for the kids. 
&nbsp;

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:35.440
In the next class, Naina asks the kids to write&nbsp;
down a list of things that they are scared of.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:44.240
After they are done, she asks them to use the list&nbsp;
as a way of letting go of the fear. The students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:49.920
tear the page and make paper airplanes with them.&nbsp;
Wadia finds one of the papers and laughs at what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:54.480
is written on it. Naina teaches the students&nbsp;
in a way that actually interests them. Even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:59.840
the students of class 9A are jealous of the fun&nbsp;
experiments that she lets the children perform.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:04.560
Wadia and his students are preparing a project&nbsp;
for the national science fair. St. Notker has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:10.960
won for the last two years, hence, Waida is hoping&nbsp;
for a third win. One day, the topper, Natasha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:16.720
invites Aatish and the group to give them a tour&nbsp;
of their project. By this time, the students of 9F&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:21.200
are just as good in their studies as the others.&nbsp;
They even suggest innovative changes that could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:26.960
be done to the project. However, when Waida finds&nbsp;
out they are messing with it, he insults Aatish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:32.160
calling him a mere bicycle mechanic. 
Later, Aatish says offensive things to Akshay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:37.520
to pick a fight with him. They almost hit each&nbsp;
other and have to be separated by Naina. Aatish&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:42.800
calls her an animal from a circus, making fun&nbsp;
of her Tourettes. Naina almost hits him but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:47.440
controls herself. That evening, she goes to&nbsp;
dinner with her family for her brother’s birthday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:52.800
Her father Sachin orders for her when she takes&nbsp;
time to do so because of her Tourettes. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:58.240
clear that he is embarrassed by her which causes&nbsp;
tension between the two yet again. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:02.880
Akshay presents their project to the school&nbsp;
teachers to practice for the science fair.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:08.080
However, the working model explodes in the middle&nbsp;
of it. Wadia apologizes to everyone for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:13.120
inconvenience, disappointed that they do not have&nbsp;
enough time to prepare a new model. On checking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:18.560
what is wrong with the model, he finds a vial of&nbsp;
glue that he had seen with Aatish earlier. 
&nbsp;

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:23.280
It is clear that Aatish messed with the model&nbsp;
to destroy it. When he is called out for it, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:28.480
entire class joins him, claiming that they helped&nbsp;
him do it, even though it was only his plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:34.240
The dean is about to expel the entire class now&nbsp;
that they have crossed a line. But Naina begs for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:39.280
him to let them take the exam because their future&nbsp;
depends on it. In the end, they are suspended from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:44.880
attending school until the exams. The students&nbsp;
are furious at Aatish for breaking Niana’s trust.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:50.320
That night, they gather by the bank of a river&nbsp;
and decide that even if they cannot go to school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:55.840
they will study hard for the exams and make their&nbsp;
teacher proud. The next day, they visit Naina and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.840 --> 00:10:01.360
apologize for everything they have done till now.&nbsp;
Sachin sees this and is proud of his daughter for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:06.320
the first time in his life. He also starts&nbsp;
to respect her as a person, realizing that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:13.360
he was in fact ashamed of her till now. 
For the next few weeks, the students do nothing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:18.640
but study. Naina invites them to her house almost&nbsp;
every day for group studies. She also provides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:23.120
them with required stationeries, preparing&nbsp;
them for the exam. The day before the exam,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:28.320
the school’s janitor offers to sell the question&nbsp;
papers to Aatish. He buys it from him and tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:33.120
give it to the others. However, they do not want&nbsp;
to cheat because that would mean betraying Naina.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.840
The morning of the exam, Aatish realizes&nbsp;
that the question papers he was provided with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:43.120
were fake. Still, the students do their&nbsp;
best and score passing marks. One of them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:49.600
named Oru, scores the highest marks, surpassing&nbsp;
everyone from class 9A. On doing some digging,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:54.880
Wadia finds out about the leaked question&nbsp;
papers and accuses everyone from 9F of cheating.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.880 --> 00:11:00.000
The janitor affirms that he sold the papers.&nbsp;
The dean cannot excuse their actions anymore.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.000
He decides to expel everyone from the&nbsp;
class in the morning assembly. 
&nbsp;

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:09.200
The students apologize to Naina for letting&nbsp;
her down but insist that they did not cheat.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:14.640
Naina believes them but she has no way to prove&nbsp;
the same to the others. Then, we see Akshay and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:20.560
Wadia walking down the hallway. Akshay reveals&nbsp;
that he was the one who sent the janitor to sell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:26.080
Aatish the fake question papers. He hopes that&nbsp;
Wadia will be proud of him but instead, he looks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:31.680
at him in disappointment. In the morning assembly,&nbsp;
the students are nervous about being expelled.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:38.080
But to their surprise, Wadia apologizes for not&nbsp;
believing in class 9F and claims that he sent the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:43.920
janitor with the fake question paper. He wants to&nbsp;
save his student as Naina did for 9F. In the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:49.520
the students are brought to the stage and two of&nbsp;
them are given the prefect badges. A year later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.760
the school takes part in the national science&nbsp;
fair competition. The students collectively&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:59.280
take part in it and win the first prize. 
Cut to twenty-five years later, Naina is now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:04.160
the principal of the school. It is her last&nbsp;
day as a teacher before getting retired.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:10.080
When she walks out, she meets the former 9F&nbsp;
members who have grown into successful adults.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:14.560
The movie ends as they reunite. 
